{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03432","headline":"至桃林塞作 · 崔湜","name":"至桃林塞作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"去国未千里，离家已再旬。\n丹心恒恋阙，白首更辞亲。\n怀璧常贻训，捐金讵得邻。\n抱冤非忤物，罹谤岂由人。\n不滥辞终辨，无瑕理竟伸。\n黻还中省旧，符与外台新。\n塞上同迁客，江潭异逐臣。\n泪垂非属岘，肠断固由秦。\n岁月行遒尽，山川难重陈。\n始知亭伯去，还是拙谋身。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"崔湜","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_03432.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_03432","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}